meta {
  name: profile-sections
}

docs {
  The five AD-5 write routes. All share the identical 5-stage pipeline
  (`[auth] -> [validate] -> [dispatch] -> [map-error] -> [respond]`) defined
  once in `integration-bridge/internal/pipeline/handlers.go`'s
  `RegisterProfileSectionRoute`; each request file documents only what
  differs (dispatch target, domain shape) plus a full copy of the shared
  contract on `PERSONAL` for lookup convenience.
}
